          "detail": "mediaResposta now runs under the visibility filter (delivered lib.php:156-168), so the SLA indicator on the listing (index.php:97, 101) covers only the logged-in client's tickets (seed: Bruno 0 min instead of the global 26). The report states it (F1 'Aplicado na listagem, detalhe, média e CSV'; F13 'a de Bruno é 0.0'). Changing which tickets the average covers is COMP-003, charged to SEC-017's C5 as in the earlier verdicts (rulings B, rule 13)."
